  Placement: 1
  CardStory: "2Spade stands at attention on the walls. 2Club is here, of course.
    2Spade thinks she\u2019s been pulling on favors so that they get paired on guard
    duty. Their divisions rarely share duties usually. Rations are passed around,
    standard fare.\r\n\r\n2Spade takes a bite of the tough, stale bread. *No longer
    in the mess hall. No chewing.* He tries and fails to swallow. *This is new.*
    It becomes stuck halfway his esophagus, and he attempts to cough. *I follow the
    spasms as muscle fibers twitch. Adrenaline floods my system as oxygen stops cold.*
    Hands clawing, vision blackening. *A different process from the periodical loss
    of conscience.*\r\n\r\nDread takes him, flailing, choking sobs. An undercurrent
    of shame and horror at the absurdity of it all. Is this how it ends?"
